@startuml Diagrama_Secuencia_HotelAPI
autonumber
actor "Cliente (Frontend/App)" as Client
participant "RoomController" as RoomCtrl
participant "ReservationController" as ResCtrl
participant "PaymentController" as PayCtrl
participant "ReservationService" as ResService
participant "RoomRepository" as RoomRepo
participant "PaymentProcessingService" as PayService
participant "PaymentGateway (Adapter)" as Gateway
participant "NotificationService" as NotifService
database "Base de Datos (SQL)" as DB

== 1. Buscar habitaciones disponibles ==
Client -> RoomCtrl: GET /api/v1/rooms/search?check_in_date=2026-12-01&check_out_date=2026-12-05&guests=2
RoomCtrl -> RoomRepo: findAvailableRooms(CriteriaDTO)
RoomRepo -> DB: SELECT rooms WHERE status='available' AND NOT EXISTS overlapping reservations
DB --> RoomRepo: [Habitaciones libres]
RoomRepo --> RoomCtrl: Collection<Room>
RoomCtrl --> Client: 200 OK + JSON [Habitaciones disponibles]

== 2. Realizar reserva ==
Client -> ResCtrl: POST /api/v1/reservations { user_id, room_id, check_in_date, check_out_date, guests_count }
ResCtrl -> ResService: makeReservation(CreateReservationDTO)
ResService -> RoomRepo: isRoomAvailableForDates(roomId, checkIn, checkOut)
RoomRepo --> ResService: true (Disponible)
ResService -> ResService: calcularNoches() & calcularTotal()
ResService -> DB: INSERT INTO reservations (status='pending_payment', total_amount=520.00)
DB --> ResService: Reservation (RES-8A7B6C)
ResService --> ResCtrl: Reservation
ResCtrl --> Client: 201 Created + JSON Reservation (pending_payment)

== 3. Gestionar pagos (Desacoplado) ==
Client -> PayCtrl: POST /api/v1/payments { reservation_id, amount: 520.00, payment_method: "credit_card", token }
PayCtrl -> PayService: processPayment(ProcessPaymentDTO)
PayService -> DB: SELECT reservation WHERE id = 1
DB --> PayService: Reservation (total_amount=520.00, status='pending_payment')
PayService -> Gateway: charge(ProcessPaymentDTO)
note over Gateway: Invocación desacoplada a pasarela externa (Stripe / PayPal / Mock)
Gateway --> PayService: PaymentResultDTO(isSuccess=true, transactionId='txn_12345')
PayService -> DB: INSERT INTO payments (status='completed', gateway_txn='txn_12345')
PayService -> DB: UPDATE reservations SET status='confirmed' WHERE id = 1
PayService -> NotifService: sendReservationConfirmation(reservation)
PayService --> PayCtrl: Payment (completed)
PayCtrl --> Client: 201 Created + JSON Payment

== 4. Recibir confirmación de reserva ==
Client -> ResCtrl: GET /api/v1/reservations/RES-8A7B6C/confirmation
ResCtrl -> ResService: getConfirmation('RES-8A7B6C')
ResService -> DB: SELECT reservation WITH user, room.hotel, payment
DB --> ResService: Reservation con relaciones
ResService --> ResCtrl: Reservation
ResCtrl --> Client: 200 OK + Voucher de Confirmación con Desglose y Firma Digital
@enduml
